# dispatch-start: the closed list of states of the machine "Dispatch start".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
ready	initial	rest	the lead approved the ticket and no start has been tried for this approval
starting	-	waiting	the spawn runs and has not said what it did
started	-	rest	the spawn ended well and the lane record is there
deferred	-	rest	the spawn said wait: a full pool, no copy, the load, the capacity or a locked task set
refused	-	rest	the spawn failed for a real cause, and only a new approval tries again
